/Violet_Crystal_Shard_55dfa2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Crystal%20Shard\">Violet Crystal Shards</a><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Blue Crystal Splinter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Crystal_Splinter_f9eab6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> 10 Blue Crystal Splinters<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Blue Crystal Shard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Crystal_Shard_a41aa3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Crystal%20Shard\">Blue Crystal Shards</a><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crystal Mace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Mace_55f59c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Crystal Mace<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crystalline Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystalline_Armor_408452.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Crystalline Armor<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crystalline Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystalline_Sword_ea1a4b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystalline%20Sword\">Crystalline Sword</a><br/>\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Mucus Plug/Statistics </i> </span>\n</p><p><br/>\nYou have a chance of getting it from a reward chest after completing any Warzone.\n</p><p>You can get the achievement Goo Goo Dancer by using 100 Muck Removers on Mucus Plugs.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by